# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Type:    feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | perf | test | chore | build | ci
# Scope:   core | agents | meeting | llm | output | data | tests | config | docs
# Subject: imperative, lowercase, no period, ≤ 72 chars
#
# Examples:
#   feat(agents): add 7 personality-based agent personas
#   fix(meeting): prevent double-counting abstention votes
#   docs(readme): add quickstart and architecture diagram
#   chore: initial commit with project scaffold
#
# Body (optional): explain WHY, not WHAT. Wrap at 72 chars.
#
# Footer (optional): Refs #issue, BREAKING CHANGE: description
